            <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-text-muted uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Önizleme — eşleşme kartı</div>
            <div class="bg-surface-1 border border-border-subtle p-4 max-w-md relative">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                <div>
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-text-primary dark:text-accent-fg">Ada Yılmaz</h3>
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[9px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border" style="color: var(--status-ok); border-color: var(--status-ok); background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--status-ok) 12%, transparent);">
                      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="9" height="9" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 2l4 4-4 4"/><path d="M3 11V9a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14"/><path d="M7 22l-4-4 4-4"/><path d="M21 13v2a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3"/></svg>
                      Karşılıklı
                    </span>
                  </div>
                  <p class="text-[10px] font-mono text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">BACKEND DEVELOPER</p>
                </div>
                <span class="border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-900 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/30 px-4 py-1.5 rounded text-xs font-bold">Bağlantı Kur</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary mb-3">Rust ve dağıtık sistemler üzerine çalışıyorum, Rails öğrenmek istiyorum.</p>
              <p class="text-[10px] font-mono text-accent mb-2">→ Rails öğretebiliyor, Rust öğrenmek istiyorsun</p>
              <div class="mb-2">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-text-muted uppercase tracking-widest">Eşleşme Kalitesi</span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-text-secondary">%87</span>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-full overflow-hidden" style="height: 6px; background-color: var(--border-subtle);">
                  <div class="h-full rounded-full" style="width: 87%; background-color: var(--chart-1);"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="text-[10px] font-mono border border-border-subtle bg-surface-2 dark:bg-transparent text-text-secondary px-2 py-0.5"><span class="text-accent">&gt;</span> Rust</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] font-mono border border-border-subtle bg-surface-2 dark:bg-transparent text-text-secondary px-2 py-0.5"><span class="text-accent">&gt;</span> gRPC</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
